   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study visit of Kenya National Fire Brigades Association representatives to Slovakia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Zdie&#x13e;anie sk&#xfa;senost&#xed; v oblasti po&#x17e;iarnej bezpe&#x10d;nosti a riadenia hasi&#x10d;sk&#xe9;ho zboru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Cie&#x13e;om projektu je identifikova&#x165; syst&#xe9;m opatren&#xed; a &#x161;tandardov, ktor&#xe9; pou&#x17e;&#xed;vaj&#xfa; hasi&#x10d;sk&#xe9; a z&#xe1;chrann&#xe9; slu&#x17e;by na Slovensku na &#xfa;&#x10d;ely porovn&#xe1;vania, monitorovania a zlep&#x161;ovania &#x10d;innosti Kenskej n&#xe1;rodnej hasi&#x10d;skej a z&#xe1;chrannej asoci&#xe1;cie KENFIBA.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims to identify a system of measures and standards that used by fire and rescue services in Slovakia for the purpose of comparison, monitoring and improving the performance of the Kenya National Fire and Rescue Association KENFIBA.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
